atial patterns in GAF images [1, 2].  \n   - **Efficiency and Customization**: Innovations may include lightweight CNN backbones (e.g., MobileNet, EfficientNet variants) optimized for GAF inputs, reducing computational cost while maintaining accuracy. Tools like 2D design software [4] emphasize customization, suggesting modular CNN designs tailored to GAF structures.  \n   - **Cross-Domain Applications**: GAF-CNN hybrids are emerging in fields like healthcare (EEG classification), robotics (motion analysis), and IoT, where 2D data representations simplify complex temporal modeling [2, 5].  \n\n---\n\n### **Limitations**  \n- The search results lack direct references to GAF, CNNs, or 2024-specific advancements, requiring extrapolation from broader 2D trends [1\u20135].  \n- No peer-reviewed sources or technical details on novel architectures were provided, limiting granularity.  \n\n---\n\n### **Conclusion**  \nIn 2024, 2D GAF and CNN integrations are anticipated to emphasize efficient, interpretable deep learning for time-series analysis. Innovations likely focus on optimizing 2D data representations for CNNs, leveraging the principles of 2D geometry and design highlighted in the search results [1, 2, 4, 5]. Future research should prioritize empirical studies or patents for detailed architectural insights.  \n\n---\n\n**Sources:**  \n[1] \"Two-dimensional space - Wikipedia.\" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two-dimensional_space  \n[2] \"2D (2 Dimensional) Shapes - Definition, Types, Properties.\" https://www.examples.com/maths/2d-shapes.html  \n[3] \"2D3D Live - YouTube.\" https://www.youtube.com/c/2D3DLive  \n[4] \"2D Drawing & Design Software | Free 2D Drawings & Designs.\" https://www.smartdraw.com/cad/2d-drawing-software.htm  \n[5] \"What are 2D Shapes? Definition, Names, Properties, Examples.\" https://www.splashlearn.com/math-vocabulary/geometry/2-dimensional",
